# Input
```html
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<!-- biome-ignore lint/a11y/noPositiveTabindex: suppressed -->
<slot
  name="icon"
  tabindex="2"
></slot>

<!-- biome-ignore lint/a11y/noPositiveTabindex: does not reach children -->
<div>
  <span tabindex="2"></span>
</div>

```

